  "interpretation": "lo_response left a residual: anchored arms place ~2.5x too deep. The tape's placement law is a broad hump \u2014 12% join at the touch, mode at 8-13 ticks, ~10% inside the spread \u2014 which NEITHER parametric family expresses on the calibrated base: no monotone d^exponent cell nor any single-mode shifted-Binomial cell reaches hist L1 <= 0.10. The placement residual is a law-family gap (the tape's law is a join/stack/improve mixture), not a parameter gap \u2014 the next mechanism is a mixture or empirical placement law.",
